<BaseLayout title="About — M. Berkan Taştan"><section class="shell py-20"><p class="kicker mb-4">Profile</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">Marine engineering, simulation and systems integration.</h1><div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr]"><div class="prose-engineering"><p>I am a graduate of Istanbul Technical University, Marine Engineering. My work focuses on R&D, system simulation, mathematical modelling, test & validation, field operations and technical project management.</p><p>In my current role, I work on simulation models, software development, integration, test infrastructure and technical operations. I have contributed to the mathematical modelling and software development of more than ten engineering modules and have managed the development of more than twenty technical user interfaces.</p><p>I am particularly interested in systems engineering problems where software must accurately represent physical behaviour and where the final solution must be testable, explainable and maintainable.</p></div><div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6"><p class="kicker">Core areas</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{['System Test & Validation','Systems Integration','Mathematical Modelling','System Simulation','LabVIEW','Test Infrastructure','Marine Machinery','Hydraulics & Pneumatics','Control Systems','Technical Documentation'].map(x=><span class="tag">{x}</span>)}</div><a href="/cv" class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-full bg-cyan-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950">Full CV →</a></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
